{"id":51010,"shortDescription":"¡Crea un próspero paraíso isleño para tu trabajadora e inteligente tribu con este Rompecabezas en tiempo real!. Tu tribu tomará sus propias decisiones, aprenderá habilidades y formará familias, incluso durante tu ausencia, pero echa un vistazo con frecuencia para que tu isla siga siendo idílica.","developers":["Big Fish Games"],"publishers":["BFG Entertainment"],"categories":["Un jugador","Cromos de Steam","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"21 ABR 2010","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/51010?t=1764678802","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51010/ss_6b65792aa319c5154e83457e871fd9d4948ac28a.600x338.jpg?t=1764678802","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51010/ss_6b65792aa319c5154e83457e871fd9d4948ac28a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764678802"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51010/ss_a8a3e9fb7ce5f43e0209ea868e10fa2e2a9a9e2a.600x338.jpg?t=1764678802","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51010/ss_a8a3e9fb7ce5f43e0209ea868e10fa2e2a9a9e2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764678802"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51010/ss_8d92541f64bb5c19aaccffa17dbc22bdabe8b390.600x338.jpg?t=1764678802","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51010/ss_8d92541f64bb5c19aaccffa17dbc22bdabe8b390.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764678802"}],"movies":[],"hltbId":31934,"hltbName":"My Tribe"}